script.gvcww2:country_sov.name=§cSoviet Union§r
script.gvcww2:country_sov_desc=The Soviet Union, also known as the USSR is Clan that focuses on overwhelming force and armor. They have a variety of tanks and vehicles, making them a formidable opponent on the battlefield. but their mobility is low.
script.gvcww2:country_ger.name=§8Nazi Germany§r
script.gvcww2:country_ger_desc=Nazi Germany, is Blitzkrieg clan that is a balanced clan that excels in both offense and defense. They have a variety of tanks and vehicles, making them a formidable opponent on the battlefield. but their armor is average.
script.gvcww2:country_usa.name=§9United States§r
script.gvcww2:country_usa_desc=The United States, is Balanced clan is a well-rounded clan that excels in both offense and defense. They have a variety of tanks and vehicles, making them a formidable opponent on the battlefield. but their mobility is average.
script.gvcww2:country_jap.name=§aEmpire of Japan§r
script.gvcww2:country_jap.desc=The Empire of Japan, is mobility clan that, specializes in speed and surprise attacks. They have access to unique vehicles and weapons, including kamikaze tactics, making them unpredictable on the battlefield. However, their armor is lighter compared to other clans.
script.gvcww2.country_eng.name=§eUnited Kingdom§r
script.gvcww2:country_eng.desc=The United Kingdom, is Defensive clan that, excels in defense and accuracy. They use smaller caliber weapons with high precision and have access to unique vehicles. Their tanks and soldiers are well-protected, but their offensive power is moderate compared to other clans.


