script.gvcv5.phone_down.name=About Down Status
script.gvcv5.phone_down0.name=When you join a team, even if your HP reaches 0, you will not die, but will instead enter a down status.
script.gvcv5.phone_down1.name=You can revive downed teammates by pressing _input_key.attack:.
script.gvcv5.phone_howToTeam.name=About Teams
script.gvcv5.phone_howToTeamDesc.name=In this mode, you will be divided into teams and engage in battle. Avoid being attacked by other teams and strengthen your own forces.
script.gvcv5.phone_howToTeam1.name=About the Information Terminal
script.gvcv5.phone_howToTeam1Desc.name=The Information Terminal is a powerful tool that assists your team's strategy. Using it allows for teleportation and information sharing. §cIf it is taken by another team, you will be at a significant disadvantage. §rSet a password to prevent others from accessing it.
script.gvcv5.phone_howToTeam2.name=About Teleportation
script.gvcv5.phone_howToTeam2Desc.name=Using the Information Terminal, you can teleport to players in your team. By using the Information Terminal of a different team, you can also teleport to enemy team players.
script.gvcv5.phone_howToTeam3.name=About Teleportation Blocks
script.gvcv5.phone_howToTeam3Desc.name=Can be created with 4 iron blocks and 1 dye. By clicking on the teleport block while holding the information terminal, you can register coordinates and teleport there at any time. Up to 5 locations can be registered per information terminal.
script.gvcv5.phone_howToTeam4.name=About allied forces
script.gvcv5.phone_howToTeam4Desc.name=By using :_input_key.use: on allied forces or their flags, you can dye them. Dyed allied forces will attack other teams' allied forces and players.
